    "description": "A large, cobra-like serpent with a broad flaring hood and a rattling tail, the Thirstaserp hides beneath the sand of Endessa, a world whose oceans were vaporized and whose surface is now desert. It emits a subsonic vibration from the rattles on its tail that can lure and mesmerize opponents long enough for it to draw near and attack with a unique venom that drains the victim's water when bitten, causing the victim to suffer and die from extreme dehydration.",
